 536+ 84E0              ; buildMapImage - render the whole 256x192 map into Layer 2
 537+ 84E0              ;
 538+ 84E0              ; Optimised: the slot-6 page offset (y/32) and the in-page
 539+ 84E0              ; address high byte ((y&$1F)|$C0) are constant for a whole row,
 540+ 84E0              ; so they are computed ONCE per row. Columns are walked with
 541+ 84E0              ; INC L (L = x, wraps 255->0). The three per-cell bank switches
 542+ 84E0              ; (map / field / radar, all at the same $C000 address) are
 543+ 84E0              ; unavoidable and remain.
 544+ 84E0              ;
 545+ 84E0              ; Trashes: AF, BC, DE, HL
